# 🖥️ PiMonitor — Raspberry Pi SSH Monitor & Auto-Reconnect

> A PowerShell script that monitors your Raspberry Pi over SSH from Windows 11.  
> Auto-reconnects when the Pi drops, plays sound alerts, and logs every event.

**Author:** Nishant T  
**Version:** 1.0  
**Platform:** Windows 11  
**Language:** PowerShell  

